{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"Angel Attack!\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"1995-10-04\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"In the year 2015, an Angel returns to attack on Tokyo-3. Misato Katsuragi transports Shinji to the NERV base overseen by his estranged father, Gendo.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3885.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"使徒, 襲来\"},{\"title\":\"The Beast\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"1995-10-11\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"After piloting the Eva Unit 01, Shinji wakes up in the hospital with no memory of the battle. Feeling sorry for him, Misato lets him move in with her.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3886.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"見知らぬ, 天井\"},{\"title\":\"A Transfer\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"1995-10-18\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Word gets around school that Shinji is the Eva pilot; his classmate Toji resents him for it. An Angel appears and Shinji must pilot in combat again.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3887.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"鳴らない, 電話\"},{\"title\":\"Hedgehog`s Dilemma\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"1995-10-25\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Stressed out following his last battle, Shinji runs away from home and meets Kensuke. After NERV brings him back in, Misato offers him a choice.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3888.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"雨, 逃げ出した後\"},{\"title\":\"Rei I\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"1995-11-01\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Unit 00's pilot Rei Ayanami appears to have recovered, but she has no friends, no records of her past, and no interest in getting to know Shinji.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3889.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"レイ, 心の向こうに\"},{\"title\":\"Rei II\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"1995-11-08\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"As the Fifth Angel drills toward NERV, Misato leads Operation Vashima: All of Japan's power will be diverted to take out Ramiel with a positron rifle.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3890.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"決戦, 第3新東京市\"},{\"title\":\"A Human Work\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"1995-11-15\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Ritsuko tells Shinji about the classified true cause of the Second Imapct. Then she and Misato attend the field test for an Eva competitor mecha.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3891.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"人の造りしもの\"},{\"title\":\"Asuka Strikes!\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"1995-11-22\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Shinji and his friends accompany Misato to meet Eva Unit 02 and its pilot Asuka at sea. Misato's old friend Ryoji Kaji is aboard with his own agenda.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3892.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"アスカ, 来日\"},{\"title\":\"Both of You, Dance Like You Want to Win!\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"1995-11-29\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Asuka and Shinji face another Angel but it gets the upper hand. They now have six days to learn synchronized moves to destroy it completely.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3893.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"瞬間, 心, 重ねて\"},{\"title\":\"Magmadiver\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"1995-12-06\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"NERV learns of an Angel in dormant embryonic form inside a volcano. Using equipment designed for magma, Asuka is sent to retrieve it with Unit 02.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3894.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"マグマダイバー\"},{\"title\":\"The Day Tokyo-3 Stood Still\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"1995-12-13\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Tokyo-3 loses power just as another Angel is detected. The Eva pilots must enter the base from the surface while NERV preps the Units manually.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3895.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"静止した闇の中で\"},{\"title\":\"She Said: \\\"Don`t Make Others Suffer for Your Personal Hatred.\\\"\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"1995-12-20\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"With Gendo and Fuyutsuki in Antarctica, a newly promoted Misato is in charge when a new Angel appears about the Earth, aiming to bomb Tokyo-3.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3896.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"奇跡の価値は\"},{\"title\":\"Lilliputian Hitcher\",\"number\":13,\"airDate\":\"1995-12-27\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"An Angel infiltrates NERV, quickly taking over the MAGI supercomputer, Ritsuko proposes writing a program to forcibly evolve Ireul to its extinction.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3897.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"使徒, 侵入\"},{\"title\":\"Weaving A Story\",\"number\":14,\"airDate\":\"1996-01-03\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"As Seele reviews NERV and Gendo's actions with the Third through Eleventh Angels, Ritsuko conducts a test in which the Eva pilots switch Units.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3898.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ゼーレ, 魂の座\"},{\"title\":\"Those Women Longed for the Touch of Others` Lips, and Thus Invited Their Kisses.\",\"number\":15,\"airDate\":\"1996-01-10\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"For the first time in years, Shinji meets his father at his mother's grave. Ritsuko, Misato and Ryoji attend a wedding and Asuka goes on a date.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3899.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"嘘と沈黙\"},{\"title\":\"Splitting of the Breast\",\"number\":16,\"airDate\":\"1996-01-17\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"While in battle, Shinji and Unit 01 are engulfed in the spreading shadow of an Angel. As NERV fears them both lost, Shinji has a strange experience.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3900.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"死に至る病, そして\"},{\"title\":\"Fourth Children\",\"number\":17,\"airDate\":\"1996-01-24\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"NERV-02 in Nevada vanishes, along with the Eva Unit 04. With Unit 03 on the way, Gendo orders Ritsuko to assign a pilot to it.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3901.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"四人目の適格者\"},{\"title\":\"Ambivalence\",\"number\":18,\"airDate\":\"1996-01-31\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Unit 03 arrives from the United States, but Shinji still doesn't know who its pilot is. During testing, NERV learns Unit 03 is possessed by an Angel.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3902.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"命の選択を\"},{\"title\":\"Introjection\",\"number\":19,\"airDate\":\"1996-02-07\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"Distraught after the battle, Shinji vows to never pilot an Eva again and quits NERV once more. Just as he's about to leave, another Angel attacks.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3903.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"男の戦い\"},{\"title\":\"Weaving a Story 2: Oral Stage\",\"number\":20,\"airDate\":\"1996-02-14\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"After achieving an unheard of synchronization rate, Shinji merges with Unit 01. While he has an out of body experience, NERV works to salvage him.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3904.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"心のかたち 人のかたち\"},{\"title\":\"He Was Aware that He Was Still a Child.\",\"number\":21,\"airDate\":\"1996-02-21\",\"duration\":29,\"synopsis\":\"Seele kidnaps Fuyutsuki and interrogates him about NERV and Gendo's true intentions, revealing events from the past. Ryoji goes missing.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3905.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ネルフ, 誕生\"},{\"title\":\"Don`t Be.\",\"number\":22,\"airDate\":\"1996-02-28\",\"duration\":29,\"synopsis\":\"Asuka's synchronization ratio continues to drop, undermining her self-confidence. Determined to show her worth, she ignores orders during battle.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3906.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"せめて, 人間らしく\"},{\"title\":\"Rei III\",\"number\":23,\"airDate\":\"1996-03-06\",\"duration\":26,\"synopsis\":\"Despite her struggles, Asuka is ordered to assist Rei in battle against Armisael. When she fails, Rei makes a desperate move in order to save Shinji.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3907.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"涙\"},{\"title\":\"The Beginning and the End, or \\\"Knockin` on the Heaven`s Door\\\"\",\"number\":24,\"airDate\":\"1996-03-13\",\"duration\":26,\"synopsis\":\"Kaworu Nagisa, the Fifth Child, comes to NERV to pilot Unit 02 in Asuka's place. He's friendly to Shinji, but he's shrouded in mystery.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3908.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"最後のシ者\"},{\"title\":\"Do You Love Me?\",\"number\":25,\"airDate\":\"1996-03-20\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The Human Instrumentality Project begins, and the souls of humanity merge. The Eva pilots confront the nature of their existence as reality dissolves.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3909.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"終わる世界\"},{\"title\":\"Take Care of Yourself.\",\"number\":26,\"airDate\":\"1996-03-27\",\"duration\":23,\"synopsis\":\"The Human Instrumentality Project continues. Shinji must decide whether to accept a world alone, or embrace connections with others.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/episodes/70350/3910.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"世界の中心でアイを叫んだけもの\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}